<title>NORWAY: Kvaerner signs 1.5 bln NOK Siri deal.</title>
<headline>Kvaerner signs 1.5 bln NOK Siri deal.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norwegian engineering and construction group Kvaerner ASA has signed a letter of intent for developing the Siri oil field in the Danish sector of the North Sea, Oslo Bourse said on Thursday.</p>
<p>It said in a statement the deal was signed by Kvaerner and state Norwegian oil company Den norske stats oljeselskap AS (Statoil).</p>
